sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / GitOps
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Reconciler as OGXServerReconciler
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant ConfigMap as ogx-operator-config<br/>ConfigMap
    participant OGXPod as OGX Server Pod<br/>HTTP

    Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 1: OGXServer Reconciliation

    User->>API: Create/Update OGXServer CR
    API->>Webhook: POST /validate-ogx-io-v1beta1-ogxserver<br/>HTTPS TLS (service-serving-cert)
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate distribution, Praxis mode,<br/>immutability rules
    Webhook-->>API: Admission Response (allow/deny)
    API-->>User: CR accepted/rejected

    API->>Reconciler: Watch event (OGXServer changed)<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Reconciler->>API: GET ogx-operator-config ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    API-->>Reconciler: ConfigMap data (image overrides)

    Reconciler->>Kustomize: Render manifests<br/>(base + transforms)
    Kustomize-->>Reconciler: Deployment, Service, PVC,<br/>NetworkPolicy, PDB, HPA, Ingress

    Reconciler->>API: Server-Side Apply resources<br/>Field owner: ogx-operator<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    API-->>Reconciler: Applied resources

    Reconciler->>OGXPod: GET /v1/version<br/>HTTP (no TLS)
    OGXPod-->>Reconciler: Version info
    Reconciler->>OGXPod: GET /v1/providers<br/>HTTP (no TLS)
    OGXPod-->>Reconciler: Provider status

    Reconciler->>API: PATCH OGXServer/status<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    API-->>Reconciler: Status updated

    Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 2: OGX Module Component Deployment

    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator
    participant ModuleCtrl as ogx-module Reconciler
    participant KustomizeM as Kustomize<br/>(platform overlay)

    PlatformOp->>API: Create/Update OGX CR<br/>(cluster-scoped)
    API->>ModuleCtrl: Watch event (OGX changed)<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    ModuleCtrl->>KustomizeM: Render with platform overlay<br/>(ODH or RHOAI)
    KustomizeM-->>ModuleCtrl: Operator manifests
    ModuleCtrl->>API: Deploy operator resources<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    ModuleCtrl->>API: Update OGX CR status<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
